{
  "$schema": "../schema/component.schema.json",
  "id": "gradient-button",
  "title": "渐变按钮",
  "description": "用于带旋转圆锥渐变发光边框的动效按钮组件。",
  "category": "basic",
  "tags": [
    "css",
    "tailwind",
    "button"
  ],
  "platforms": [
    "web"
  ],
  "props": [
    {
      "name": "borderWidth",
      "type": "number",
      "required": false,
      "description": "渐变边框的像素宽度。",
      "default": "2"
    },
    {
      "name": "colors",
      "type": "string[]",
      "required": false,
      "description": "用于圆锥渐变边框的颜色数组。",
      "default": "() => [\n    \"#FF0000\",\n    \"#FFA500\",\n    \"#FFFF00\",\n    \"#008000\",\n    \"#0000FF\",\n    \"#4B0082\",\n    \"#EE82EE\",\n    \"#FF0000\",\n  ]"
    },
    {
      "name": "duration",
      "type": "number",
      "required": false,
      "description": "渐变旋转动画的持续时间（毫秒）。",
      "default": "2500"
    },
    {
      "name": "borderRadius",
      "type": "number",
      "required": false,
      "description": "圆角半径（像素）。",
      "default": "8"
    },
    {
      "name": "blur",
      "type": "number",
      "required": false,
      "description": "渐变边框的模糊强度（像素）。",
      "default": "4"
    },
    {
      "name": "class",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "description": "用于自定义样式的额外 CSS 类。",
      "default": "\"\""
    },
    {
      "name": "bgColor",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "description": "按钮内容的背景色。",
      "default": "\"#000\""
    }
  ],
  "events": [],
  "slots": [
    {
      "name": "default",
      "description": ""
    }
  ],
  "exposes": [],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Web 演示",
      "code": "<script lang=\"ts\" setup>\nimport { useColorMode } from \"@vueuse/core\";\nimport { computed } from \"vue\";\n\nconst isDark = computed(() => useColorMode().value == \"dark\");\nconst bgColor = computed(() => (isDark.value ? \"#000\" : \"#fff\"));\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <div class=\"z-10 flex h-56 w-full flex-col items-center justify-center\">\n    <GradientButton :bg-color=\"bgColor\">Zooooooooooom 🚀</GradientButton>\n  </div>\n</template>\n",
      "source": "demo",
      "platform": "web"
    }
  ],
  "related": [],
  "whenToUse": [
    "落地页主 CTA 需要持续旋转的渐变发光边框吸引注意。",
    "需要自定义边框颜色数组（colors）与模糊光晕（blur）的按钮。"
  ],
  "whenNotToUse": [
    "常规功能按钮（含 uniapp），改用 reborn-button。",
    "需要光斑扫过效果，改用 shimmer-button；需要彩虹底色，改用 rainbow-button。"
  ],
  "pitfalls": [
    "仅 web 端可用。",
    "bgColor 是按钮内容区背景色（默认 #000），浅色主题下需自行改为浅色，示例中依据明暗模式切换。",
    "duration 单位为毫秒（默认 2500）；colors 需首尾同色才能无缝旋转（默认数组首尾均为 #FF0000）。",
    "未定义 click 等事件声明，按钮文字通过默认插槽传入。"
  ],
